  "version": 1,
  "_doc": "Phase 17: encouragement companions (data-driven). Adding a companion = a folder app/assets/companions/<id>/<pose>.webp + one entry here. subjects: list of subject ids or \"*\" (any subject, incl. future ones). poses lists the sprites that exist; missing poses fall back (think->idle, celebrate->happy). Selection: the subject's own companions first, then the '*' pool; never the same companion two sessions in a row (per child); the child can pin a favourite in the profile. Phase 18.5: optional rig.limbs = [{id,x,y,w,h (percent of the sprite box), origin, motion: flutter|flap|sway}] -> each box becomes its own mask layer with an infinite loop (wings flutter, tail sways) and is cut out of the body layer so nothing is drawn twice.",
